+- Q: You ended your first mission answer with "Imagine sharing that focus with a like-minded group of energetic builders." What kind of team do you hope to build with?
+  A: "I'm a self-starter, who can identify opportunity, markets, users and create the viable cost-effective fit that works. I co-authored the Medic AI strategy that earned us funding cycles and grants throughout 2025 and 2026. I worked hard cross-dimensionally to effectively identify when AI could be valuable for our goals. I'm looking to join a hyper-speed team, where everyone is like that. Imagine what we could do together, if there was rooms of us."
